                "Raffin-Staple RS-2 / Extractive-Still ES-7 carries 41.6 C furfural raffinate, "
                "well under the 58 C fouling trip, yet the crown lamp still flashes 73 C. "
                "Binding the raffinate RTD first keeps the 5.2 t/h feed; binding the crown lamp "
                "first would park a legal extractive still.",